Neon: a tab an extension opens from a tab lands in that tab's space (M5).

chrome.tabs.create with openerTabId opens the tab in the opener's container.
Other tabs an extension opens land in the space visible in the target window
(the new tab container provider), and extension pages in the global window
(extensions/global-window.patch).

